<% layout('layouts/boilerplate.ejs') -%>

<div class="container my-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center text-center mb-5">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
            <h1 class="fw-bold mb-3">Welcome to RoamHaven</h1>
            <p class="lead text-muted">
                Your guide to discovering extraordinary stays, planning trips, and hosting travelers from around the world.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 p-4 border rounded-3 shadow-sm text-center">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-compass fa-3x text-danger"></i>
                </div>
                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-2">1. Explore Unique Stays</h4>
                <p class="text-muted">
                    Browse hundreds of distinctive homes—from beachfront cottages and mountain chalets to private islands and rustic treehouses.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 p-4 border rounded-3 shadow-sm text-center">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-location fa-3x text-danger"></i>
                </div>
                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-2">2. Search & Filter</h4>
                <p class="text-muted">
                    Find exactly what fits your travel style by selecting category icons or searching by destination city, title, or country.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 p-4 border rounded-3 shadow-sm text-center">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-house-chimney-user fa-3x text-danger"></i>
                </div>
                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-2">3. Host Your Property</h4>
                <p class="text-muted">
                    Share your space with travelers worldwide. Create an account, list your home, set pricing, and welcome guests.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-4 text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
            <div class="accordion shadow-sm" id="helpAccordion">
                
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingOne">
                        <button class="accordion-button fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                            How do I search for places in a specific city or country?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne" data-bs-parent="#helpAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                            Use the search bar at the top of any page. Type in a city (like <em>Malibu</em> or <em>Florence</em>), a country (like <em>United States</em> or <em>Italy</em>), or a property title. Press <strong>Search</strong> or hit Enter to view matching results.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                            How do category filters work?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#helpAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                            On the Explore page, browse through the category bar at the top (such as <em>Trending, Mountains, Amazing Pools, Castles, Camping</em>). Click on any category icon to instantly display properties matching that style. Click <strong>All</strong> or <strong>Clear All Filters</strong> to reset your selection.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                            What does the "Display total after taxes" switch do?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree" data-bs-parent="#helpAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                            By default, prices are shown as the base nightly rate. When you flip the <strong>"Display total after taxes"</strong> toggle switch on the right side of the category bar, all prices dynamically calculate and show the estimated final price including standard 18% taxes (GST). Your toggle preference is remembered as you browse across pages.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFour">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">
                            How do I list my own property?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour" data-bs-parent="#helpAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                            1. Click <strong>Sign up</strong> or <strong>Log in</strong> in the top navigation bar.<br />
                            2. Once logged in, click <strong>Host a Haven</strong>.<br />
                            3. Fill in the property details: title, description, category, photo URL, nightly price, city/location, and country.<br />
                            4. Click <strong>Submit</strong>. Your property will immediately be live on RoamHaven with an interactive map location.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFive">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">
                            Can anyone edit or delete my listing?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFive" data-bs-parent="#helpAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                            No. RoamHaven enforces strict ownership rules. Only the verified user account that created a listing has permission to view the Edit and Delete buttons and modify property information.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingSix">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSix" aria-controls="collapseSix">
                            How do reviews and star ratings work?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseSix" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingSix" data-bs-parent="#helpAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                            Logged-in guests can leave genuine feedback on any listing page. Select your 1 to 5 star rating, write your review, and submit. You can also delete your own reviews at any time.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row justify-content-center text-center">
        <div class="col-lg-8 py-4 bg-light rounded-3 border">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-2">Ready to discover your next destination?</h4>
            <p class="text-muted mb-3">Explore unique stays around the globe today.</p>
            <a href="/Listings" class="btn btn-theme btn-lg px-4">
                Start Exploring
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
